      "title": "Token renewal on the shell's pending curation read",
      "summary": "The shell's pending curation read renews an expired access token once and ends the session when renewal fails, while the health read stays without a bearer."
    },
    {
      "id": "inventory/shell-pending-token-renewal",
      "kind": "inventory",
      "file": "inventory/shell-pending-token-renewal.md",
      "title": "Shell pending curation read and the frontend's token-renewal code",
      "summary": "The area the pending-read renewal scope lands in, which is one shell hook in frontend/src/shell/api that has no renewal, beside four request wrappers that each carry their own copy of the 401 renew-and-retry."
    },
    {
